<p>One thing I liked about this was the elaboration on D-Class culture. It doesn't fit my headcanon<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-198052-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-198052-1')">1</a></sup>, but it seemed appropriate.</p>
<p>BTW, is Red connected to/part of the Scarlet King?</p>
